% Expressions locating an entity or event in time or space without specifying
% the relation (now, here, every day, ...) introduce a 'loc_nonsp' relation
% between the located eventuality and the location entity.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_ImplicitLocatives/):
%   loc_nonsp[ARG1 i, ARG2 x]

pattern { L [pred="loc_nonsp"]; L -[1=ARG1]-> E; L -[1=ARG2]-> X }
